{"4814280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Marie Android", "steam_appid": 4814280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~ Do you like Marie‑chan? ~</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marie Android, a small girl‑like android, meets many friends on her journey. With mysterious powers, she can become incredibly muscular, flatten into a paper‑thin form, or even transform into a giant tank to fight enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Borrow the strength of your friends and save <strong>Akacha Town</strong>, the stage of your adventure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■■■■ <strong>Highlights</strong> ■■■■</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied 3D action with unique gimmicks</strong> – Every small map features its own mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylish puzzle‑solving</strong> – Entire dungeons function as interconnected mechanisms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story that keeps you curious</strong> – …probably.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■■■■ <strong>Additional Notes</strong> ■■■■</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer: Aoyama Jinbey</strong> – working solo.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustration, pixel art, 3D modeling, animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lyrics, composition,  vocals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenario writing, dungeon level design, puzzle and gimmick design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character voice  by two people:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Korone Pochi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aoyama Jinbey</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~ Do you like Marie‑chan? ~</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marie Android, a small girl‑like android, meets many friends on her journey. With mysterious powers, she can become incredibly muscular, flatten into a paper‑thin form, or even transform into a giant tank to fight enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Borrow the strength of your friends and save <strong>Akacha Town</strong>, the stage of your adventure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■■■■ <strong>Highlights</strong> ■■■■</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied 3D action with unique gimmicks</strong> – Every small map features its own mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylish puzzle‑solving</strong> – Entire dungeons function as interconnected mechanisms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story that keeps you curious</strong> – …probably.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■■■■ <strong>Additional Notes</strong> ■■■■</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer: Aoyama Jinbey</strong> – working solo.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustration, pixel art, 3D modeling, animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lyrics, composition,  vocals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenario writing, dungeon level design, puzzle and gimmick design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character voice  by two people:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Korone Pochi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aoyama Jinbey</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Do you like Marie‑chan? You play as Marie Android, a small girl‑like robot who meets many friends. Using mysterious powers, she can become muscular, flatten into a paper‑thin form, or transform into a giant tank to fight enemies. Borrow your friends’ abilities and save Akacha Town.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814280/e4c2e1dbea110027ec63e6fbd43e151438a38bcf/header.jpg?t=1781952251", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814280/0a84145d155d9d55935f